isplays "Remember to play slycrel" at logon.  what do I do to turn it off?  well.. get that snazzy thingy I mentioned above 'Set Herms' and turn off the "CHECK LOGON" check box.  You can mess around w/ all those but be warned I don't know what the side effects would be! (most likely nothing major, I hope) ¥	I found a bug not in the list!  HELP!   E-Mail us!  I will not be available for 2 years.  I am leaving on a LDS mission for 2 years & you most likely won't be able to get in touch w/ me.  However, my brother Bill Dolinar has told me that he will maintain the code and take care of registrations.  You should include what the error is (numeric error code if one is given), details about when it happens, what other externals you are running, what system version, what hermes version, and what type of computer you're running; if you include these things I will be more likely to get the bug fixed.Internet:  ddolinar@utw.com	(dunno how long this will be good for)Olympus: "Dave Dolinar" or "Bill Dolinar"					(These should be good 'forever')my BBS:   (801)756-6417   			(I'm the Sysop, my bro will keep it up for a while)Things for the Future:Æ	Addition of Smart Monsters that actually SHOOT and manuver w/ a little stratagie.Æ	Addition of Class specific Guilds so that the uesrs can go up in levels.Æ	NPC (non-playing-characters) that you can interact with.Æ	CC's (computer characters) These will basically be like other users playing only they'll be controlled by the computer, this should make for a fun game on a BBS where only 1 or 2 people play the game.Æ	Plug In's... we already have a good idea of how we are going to do this, just have to get around to implementing it, and we had this idea *before* LORD came out w/ their plugins!Æ	Addition of real melee weapons, armor, and ranged weapons.Æ	Addition of monsters & terrain maps.Æ	Anything else that you guys suggest that we like & can implement.Thanks:+	Show Boat Girl and her friends at Disco Skating who distrac